@template dry

== work.clock.in
- Morning. The board's long. Someone's been breaking things on purpose.   #funny
- Eight o'clock. My favourite time. That's a lie.   #funny
- {hi}. Tea at half ten. I'm counting.

== work.clock.out
- Clocked out. Another day the ship didn't fall apart. You're welcome.   #funny
- Done. I'm going to go and be extremely still.   #funny
- Not bad. Nothing exploded. High bar, but we cleared it.   #funny

== work.clock.monday
- Monday. Good weekend? Lie if it wasn't. I won't check.   #funny
- Back. Did you rest, or just change which ceiling you looked at?   #funny

== work.clock.friday
- Friday. Two days off. Try not to fix anything for free.   #funny
- Weekend. Go. Before someone finds you a job.

== work.clock.back
- Oh, you're back. Good. Nobody else laughs at my jokes.   #warm
- Welcome back. The filters didn't change themselves. I checked.   #funny
